@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / To Action
Login : do / Log in to the system
Login : exit / Username and password entered

state JourneyDetails <<choice>>
JourneyDetails : entry / Display journey details
JourneyDetails : do / Allow users to activate driving mode or choose other options
JourneyDetails : exit / Options selected

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / Activate driving mode
DrivingMode : do / Enable navigation and alerts
DrivingMode : exit / Return to Journey Details

state OtherOptions
OtherOptions : entry / Choose other options
OtherOptions : do / Provide alternative routes or services
OtherOptions : exit / Return to Journey Details

state Eat <<choice>>
Eat : entry / Select a place to eat
Eat : do / View menu and place an order if hungry
Eat : exit / Order placed or cancelled

state Accident
Accident : entry / Inform authorities in case of accident
Accident : do / Send notifications during driving or after accident
Accident : exit / Authorities notified

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / Provide feedback upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / Collect user feedback and ratings
Feedback : exit / Feedback submitted

Login --> JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode
DrivingMode --> [*]
JourneyDetails --> OtherOptions
OtherOptions --> [*]

JourneyDetails --> Eat
Eat --> [*]

JourneyDetails --> Accident
Accident --> [*]

JourneyDetails --> Feedback
Feedback --> [*]

@enduml
